OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a cold start to day the
OL,6,Fday this morning will be dry with
OL,7,Fsunny intervals. Then this afternoon
OL,8,Fwill remain dry with plenty of
OL,9,Fsunshine. Cold.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry and
OL,12,Fclear. Then the rest of the night will
OL,13,Fbe dry with lengthy clear periods and
OL,14,Fa widespread sharp frost.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FAfter a frosty start all
OL,17,Fparts will have a dry, cold and sunny
OL,18,Fday. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
