OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry on
OL,6,FSunday, overnight frost. Dry for most
OL,7,Fof Monday but rain likely to spread
OL,8,Ffrom the west by Tuesday.
